      "title": "\u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 RIFE Frame Interpolation",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 RIFE Frame Interpolation\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 Frame Interpolation (RIFE v4.26)\n**Model:** `rife_v4.26.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/frame_interpolation/`\n> Doubles video FPS \u2014 24fps \u2192 48fps, 25fps \u2192 50fps\n\n---\n## \ud83e\udde9 Required Custom Nodes\n- rgthree-comfy (before/after comparer)\n- Loading, frame interpolation and saving are built into ComfyUI\n\n---\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips\n- Set **Multiplier**: 2 doubles frame count and FPS, 4 quadruples\n- Output FPS is set automatically (source FPS \u00d7 multiplier), so the video keeps its speed and stays in sync with the audio\n- Works with silent videos (Wan) and videos with sound (InfiniteTalk)\n- Want slow motion instead? Disconnect fps on Create Video and type in the source FPS\n- Output is saved to `output/video/`\n\n---\n## \ud83d\udcda ApexForge by Alex Harte\n\ud83c\udf10 **Guides & updates:** https://alexanderharte.com\n\ud83d\ude80 **All models are pre-installed on your pod.**\n\ud83c\udfa8 **Just load this workflow and start generating.**"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# \u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 RIFE Frame Interpolation\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 Frame Interpolation (RIFE v4.26)\n**Model:** `rife_v4.26.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/frame_interpolation/`\n> Doubles video FPS \u2014 24fps \u2192 48fps, 25fps \u2192 50fps\n\n---\n## \ud83e\udde9 Required Custom Nodes\n- rgthree-comfy (before/after comparer)\n- Loading, frame interpolation and saving are built into ComfyUI\n\n---\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips\n- Set **Multiplier**: 2 doubles frame count and FPS, 4 quadruples\n- Output FPS is set automatically (source FPS \u00d7 multiplier), so the video keeps its speed and stays in sync with the audio\n- Works with silent videos (Wan) and videos with sound (InfiniteTalk)\n- Want slow motion instead? Disconnect fps on Create Video and type in the source FPS\n- Output is saved to `output/video/`\n\n---\n## \ud83d\udcda ApexForge by Alex Harte\n\ud83c\udf10 **Guides & updates:** https://alexanderharte.com\n\ud83d\ude80 **All models are pre-installed on your pod.**\n\ud83c\udfa8 **Just load this workflow and start generating.**"
      },
      "color": "#231535",
      "bgcolor": "#3f2460"
    },
